      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Forgot to say but if the auto hiding feature caters to OLED headsets, this feature I've requested in tandem with the auto hiding would cater well towards headsets with Local Dimming.\n\nThe current behavior doesn't work as well for locally dimmed headsets and a more immediate hiding effect would be much appreciated.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
