  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-23T02:26:46.672Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Love the new microphone auto hiding idea but I'd like to go one step further in hiding unneeded UI clutter\n\nPlease allow us an option to hide only the microphone's unmuted and not talking state.\n\nI currently play with the microphone completely hidden as this microphone state ruins the quest pros local dimming.\n\nThe auto hiding is nice but I'd like to skip the step between stopping talking and having the UI hide itself completely by hiding this unneeded UI element stage.",
